<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Vendor Schedule Details</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f4f7fa;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            color: #333;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .email-container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 30px auto;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .email-body {
            padding: 20px 30px;
        }

        .email-body p {
            margin: 15px 0;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #555;
        }

        .highlight {
            background-color: #f1f9ff;
            padding: 10px;
            border-left: 4px solid #0073e6;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .button-link {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 10px 15px;
            background-color: #0073e6;
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 5px;
            font-size: 14px;
            margin: 15px 0;
        }

        .button-link:hover {
            background-color: #005bb5;
        }

        .email-footer {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 20px;
            background-color: #f9f9f9;
        }

        .green-line {
            width: 4px;
            background-color: #00b050;
            height: auto;
            margin-right: 15px;
        }

        .footer-content {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 15px;
        }

        .company-logo img {
            max-width: 75px;
            height: auto;
            margin-right: 15px;
        }

        .details h2 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 16px;
            color: #084179;
        }

        .details p {
            margin: 3px 0;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #555;
        }

        .details a {
            color: #0073e6;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .details a:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="email-container">
        <!-- Body Section -->
        <div class="email-body">
            <p>Dear <strong><%= leadResponderName %></strong>,</p>
                <p><strong>Subject:</strong> Vendor Assessment Request</p>
            <p>
                I hope this letter finds you well. We appreciate the ongoing partnership between our companies and the valuable products/services that your company provides. As part of our commitment to maintaining the highest quality and standards, we periodically conduct vendor audits to ensure compliance, efficiency, and quality control. We have decided to audit your company to foster mutual growth and drive meaningful improvements together.
            </p>
            
             <div class="details">
             <h2> Company Reference </h2>
                    <p><%= userCompanyName %></p>
                    <p><%= userCompanyAddress %></p>
                    <p>Email: <a href="mailto:<%= userEmail %>"><%= userEmail %></a></p>
                    <p>Contact: <%= userContactNumber %></p>
                </div>

            
            <p>
We are providing access to our portal to complete the questionnaire. Login and password details will be sent in separate emails.            </p>
            <p>
The audit will encompass various aspects of our partnership, including quality assurance, supply chain efficiency, contractual terms compliance, and an overall business relationship assessment. We believe this audit will help identify areas where we can collaborate to optimize operations and enhance the service quality we provide our customers.            </p>

            <p> I appreciate your cooperation.</p>
            <p>Best Regards,</p>
            <p><strong><%= leadReviewerName %></strong></p>
            <p><%= leadReviewerTitle %></p>
            <p>Email: <%= leadReviewerEmail %> | Contact: <%= leadReviewerContactNumber %></p>
        </div>

         <!-- Footer Section -->
         <div class="email-footer">
            <!-- Green Line -->
            <div class="green-line"></div>

            <!-- Footer Content -->
            <div class="footer-content">
                <!-- Logo Section -->
                <div class="company-logo">
                    <img src="<%= companyLogoUrl %>" alt="Company Logo">
                </div>

                <!-- Details Section -->
                <div class="details">
                    <h2><%= userCompanyName %></h2>
                    <p><%= userCompanyAddress %></p>
                    <p>Email: <a href="mailto:<%= userEmail %>"><%= userEmail %></a></p>
                    <p>Contact: <%= userContactNumber %></p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>
</body>

</html>
